        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF146 adds support for the MathML CSS <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/math-shift\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">math-shift</code></a> property in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1994171\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1994171</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3607745179\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41877\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41877/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41877\">mdn/content#41877</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28511",
            "title": "FF146 MathML - math-shift CSS property",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-23T23:17:40.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-23T23:15:31.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 142 adds support for range syntax in style queries, both in CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">@container</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">if()</code>. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5184992749289472\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5184992749289472</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-chrome-142#range-syntax\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-chrome-142#range-syntax</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a separate data point for the new feature as used in each of the two contexts.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28496.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3649284770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28496\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28496/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28496\">#28496</a></p>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28510",
            "title": "Chrome 142 range syntax for style queries",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-23T15:19:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-23T15:19:06.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56214343?u=508d80be76d3b726fffd2c8ec9dd2173add50079&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Bun 1.3.3 added <code class=\"notranslate\">CompressionStream</code> &amp; <code class=\"notranslate\">DecompressionStream</code> for the standard \"gzip\", \"deflate\" and \"deflate-raw\" formats, and also supports \"brotli\" and \"zstd\".</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As no other platforms have zstd yet I added it, but I can also remove if its meant to have more usage first.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.3.3#compressionstream-and-decompressionstream\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bun v1.3.3 release notes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1651772296\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/compression/issues/54\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/compression/issues/54/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/compression/issues/54\">whatwg/compression#54</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
